  <string name="privacy_intro_title">Introduction</string>
  <string name="privacy_intro_content">Welcome to %1$s! This notice explains what %1$s collects, why, and who receives it. Tap Agree to accept it. Analytics are sent only after you agree.</string>
  <string name="privacy_data_collection_title">Data Collection</string>
  <string name="privacy_data_collection_content">Connections analytics: %1$s sends the following to Connections (connections.icu): your phone model and Android version; your app settings and wallpaper choices; the names and wallpaper counts of your albums; which pictures are shown and when, by file name; your Connections account ID when you are signed in; and the screens you open and the actions you take in the app.\n\nNotifications: %1$s requests permission to display its own wallpaper-change, background-operation, and error notifications. It does not read notifications from other apps or use them to recommend wallpapers.\n\nLocal Files: %1$s accesses the images and folders you select so it can set them as wallpapers. The pictures themselves are never uploaded; only their file names are sent, as described above.\n\nConnections gallery: when you open the Explore tab, %1$s loads wallpaper previews from wallpaper.connectionsapi.com. When you set one as your wallpaper or add it to an album, it downloads the full-size picture with your Connections sign-in and saves it to Pictures/Connections Wallpaper.</string>
  <string name="privacy_information_usage_title">Information Usage</string>
  <string name="privacy_information_usage_content">Purpose: Connections uses this data for analytics, personalization, product and marketing, and to build its own intelligence graph. %1$s never sells it, and it is not used for other companies\' advertising.\n\nAccount: signing in with Connections links this data to your account ID. Your name, email address and profile picture stay on this phone and are not sent.\n\nRandom ID: every install also gets a random ID, which is sent with the data.</string>
  <string name="privacy_data_security_title">Data Security</string>
  <string name="privacy_data_security_content">On-Device Storage: your albums, settings and sign-in stay on your device. Analytics waits in a local queue until it is sent, and nothing is recorded before you agree. %1$s goes online to browse or download Connections wallpapers, to sign in, and to send analytics to Connections.</string>
